    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>DISEASE SAVE SOUL UNLIVING-GHOUL</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 10</p>\n<p>Your corpse-hunger can spread as a feverish curse in the blood of those you maul.</p>\n<p>When you inflict a critical injury with your Bite, the target must attempt a Fortitude save against Ghoul Fever. The disease level is equal to your level. A creature can be exposed to your Ghoul Fever only once per day.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: a critical injury with your Bite exposes the target to Ghoul Fever at your level (its own Fortitude exposure save), once a day per creature.</p>",
